    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "heatmap",
      "title": "03 · Структура ВО: Micrometer SLO buckets, 60 с",
      "description": "Cumulative buckets → непересекающиеся интервалы преобразуются Prometheus datasource Format=Heatmap. Calculate from data=false: Grafana не перебакетирует наблюдения. Значение цвета — requests/s в данном интервале; Y — upper bound в секундах с форматированием времени. Buckets >50ms и +Inf исключены из картинки, доля overflow видна ниже. Верхняя граница 50 ms служит увеличением области возможных мод, buckets до 1 s сохранены в VM.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "victoria-metrics"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 12,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 12
      },
      "interval": "2s",
      "maxDataPoints": 2000,
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "victoria-metrics"
          },
          "format": "heatmap",
          "expr": "sum by (le) (rate(exp4_request_duration_seconds_bucket{experiment=\"experiment4\",service=\"java\",status=\"200\",le!~\"\\\\+Inf|1\\\\.0|0\\\\.(06|075|1|15|25|5)\"}[60s]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{le}}",
          "refId": "A",
          "editorMode": "code",
          "range": true,
          "instant": false
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "reqps",
          "custom": {
            "hideFrom": {
              "tooltip": false,
              "viz": false,
              "legend": false
            },
            "scaleDistribution": {
              "type": "linear"
            }
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "calculate": false,
        "cellGap": 0,
        "cellValues": {
          "unit": "reqps",
          "decimals": 1
        },
        "color": {
          "mode": "scheme",
          "scheme": "Oranges",
          "steps": 128,
          "reverse": false,
          "scale": "exponential",
          "exponent": 0.5,
          "min": 0,
          "fill": "dark-orange"
        },
        "exemplars": {
          "color": "rgba(255,0,255,0.7)"
        },
        "filterValues": {
          "le": 0
        },
        "legend": {
          "show": true
        },
        "rowsFrame": {
          "layout": "auto"
        },
        "showValue": "never",
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "single",
          "showColorScale": true,
          "yHistogram": false
        },
        "yAxis": {
          "axisPlacement": "left",
          "unit": "s",
          "min": 0,
          "max": 0.05,
          "reverse": false,
          "decimals": 3
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "04 · Sigma и mean индивидуальных ВО",
      "description": "Sigma = sqrt(E[x²]−E[x]²), x — индивидуальное время серверного /work в секундах. exp4_request_duration_seconds_squared_sum — накопленная сумма квадратов, а не sigma по усредненным точкам. Окно 60 с. Рост sigma сам по себе не доказывает бимодальность.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "victoria-metrics"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 24,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "victoria-metrics"
          },
          "expr": "sqrt(clamp_min(sum(rate(exp4_request_duration_seconds_squared_sum{experiment=\"experiment4\",service=\"java\",status=\"200\"}[60s])) / sum(rate(exp4_request_duration_seconds_count{experiment=\"experiment4\",service=\"java\",status=\"200\"}[60s])) - (sum(rate(exp4_request_duration_seconds_sum{experiment=\"experiment4\",service=\"java\",status=\"200\"}[60s])) / sum(rate(exp4_request_duration_seconds_count{experiment=\"experiment4\",service=\"java\",status=\"200\"}[60s]))) ^ 2, 0))",
          "legendFormat": "sigma",
          "refId": "A",
          "editorMode": "code",
          "range": true,
          "instant": false
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "victoria-metrics"
          },
          "expr": "sum(rate(exp4_request_duration_seconds_sum{experiment=\"experiment4\",service=\"java\",status=\"200\"}[60s])) / sum(rate(exp4_request_duration_seconds_count{experiment=\"experiment4\",service=\"java\",status=\"200\"}[60s]))",
          "legendFormat": "mean",
          "refId": "B",
          "editorMode": "code",
          "range": true,
          "instant": false
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "min": 0,
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineInterpolation": "linear",
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 8,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": false,
            "axisPlacement": "auto",
            "axisLabel": "",
